===========================================================================
$NetBSD$

86Box requires a ROM set to emulate most machines.  Install the
emulators/86box-roms package, which installs the ROMs into
${PREFIX}/share/86Box/roms, one of 86Box's default search paths.

If 86Box does not find the ROMs, make sure XDG_DATA_DIRS includes
${PREFIX}/share (pkgsrc's Qt5 adds it automatically when the
XDG_DATA_DIRS environment variable is unset), or point 86Box at the
ROM directory using the "--rompath" command line option or the
"rom_path" setting in 86box.cfg.

